! 💎"]},"tos":{"vendorTitle":"Vendor Agreement","customerTitle":"Welcome to the Store","vendorWelcome":"Welcome, {{name}}! Please review and accept the following agreements for {{shop}}.","customerWelcome":"Welcome, {{name}}! Please review and accept our terms before you start shopping.","selectAll":"Select All — I have read and agree to all terms below","agreeSection":"I have read and agree to the {{section}}","vendorAccept":"I Accept All & Continue","customerAccept":"I Accept & Start Shopping","pleaseAccept":"Please read and accept all sections above to continue","termsTitle":"Terms of Service","disclaimerTitle":"Service Disclaimer & Liability Limitation","privacyTitle":"Privacy & Data Protection","acceptableUseTitle":"Acceptable Use Policy","dmcaTitle":"DMCA & Intellectual Property"},"poweredBy":{"disclaimer":"This website is independently operated by its owner. Storzu provides the technology platform only and is not responsible for any products, services, or content on this site.","poweredBy":"Powered by","allRightsReserved":"All rights reserved."},"legal":{"privacyTitle":"Privacy Policy","termsTitle":"Terms of Service","acceptableUseTitle":"Acceptable Use Policy","dmcaTitle":"DMCA & Copyright Policy","lastUpdated":"Last updated: March 24, 2026","privacyIntro":"Storzu (\\"we,\\" \\"us,\\" or \\"the Platform\\") is committed to protecting the privacy of our Vendors and their customers. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and protect personal information in connection with our website creation and hosting services.","privacyS2Title":"2. Information We Collect","privacyS2VendorTitle":"From Vendors (Account Holders)","privacyS2Vendor1":"Name and contact information (phone number, email address)","privacyS2Vendor2":"Business information (shop name, business category)","privacyS2Vendor3":"Account credentials (hashed passwords — we never store plain-text passwords)","privacyS2Vendor4":"Website configuration and template preferences","privacyS2Vendor5":"Usage data and interaction logs","privacyS2VisitorTitle":"From Vendor Website Visitors","privacyS2Visitor":"Storzu may collect basic analytics data (page views, browser type) to maintain platform performance. Individual Vendors are responsible for their own data collection practices and must comply with applicable privacy laws regarding their customers\' data.","privacyS3Title":"3. How We Use Information","privacyS3Items":["To provide, maintain, and improve our Platform services","To create and manage Vendor accounts and websites","To communicate with Vendors about their accounts and services","To ensure platform security and prevent abuse","To comply with legal obligations"],"privacyS4Title":"4. Data Storage & Security","privacyS4Intro":"Your data is stored securely using industry-standard practices. We use:","privacyS4Items":["PostgreSQL database storage with row-level security","Global CDN and hosting with enterprise-grade DDoS protection","bcrypt hashing for password storage","HTTPS/TLS encryption for all data in transit","HTTP-only secure cookies for session management"],"privacyS5Title":"5. Data Sharing","privacyS5Intro":"We do not sell your personal information. We may share data with:","privacyS5Items":["Trusted infrastructure providers (database, hosting, CDN) for service delivery","Law enforcement when required by law or valid legal process","Third parties with your explicit consent"],"privacyS6Title":"6. Vendor Data Processing","privacyS6Intro":"As a technology provider, Storzu processes Vendor data solely for the purpose of delivering our services. Vendors act as independent data controllers for any personal data they collect from their own customers. Vendors are responsible for:","privacyS6Items":["Publishing their own privacy policy on their vendor website","Obtaining necessary consent from their customers","Complying with applicable data protection laws (GDPR, CCPA, IT Act, etc.)","Responding to data subject access requests from their customers"],"privacyS7Title":"7. Cookies","privacyS7":"We use essential cookies for session management and authentication. These are HTTP-only secure cookies required for the Platform to function. We do not use third-party tracking cookies on the main Storzu platform.","privacyS8Title":"8. Data Retention","privacyS8":"We retain Vendor account data for as long as the account is active. Upon account termination, data is retained for up to 30 days to allow for reactivation, after which it is permanently deleted. Webhook logs and delivery records are retained for 90 days.","privacyS9Title":"9. Your Rights","privacyS9Intro":"You have the right to:","privacyS9Items":["Access the personal data we hold about you","Request correction of inaccurate data","Request deletion of your data (subject to legal retention requirements)","Export your data in a portable format","Object to or restrict certain data processing"],"privacyS10Title":"10. Contact","privacyS10":"For privacy-related questions or requests, contact us at:","termsS1Title":"1. Platform Overview","termsS1":"Storzu (\\"we,\\" \\"us,\\" or \\"the Platform\\") is a technology platform that provides website creation and hosting tools for merchants and vendors (\\"Vendors\\"). Storzu is solely a technology service provider. We do not sell, manufacture, or distribute any products or services offered by Vendors on their websites hosted through our Platform.","termsS2Title":"2. Acceptance of Terms","termsS2":"By registering for an account or using the Storzu Platform, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree, you must not use the Platform. We reserve the right to update these Terms at any time. Continued use after changes constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.","termsS3Title":"3. Vendor Responsibilities","termsS3Intro":"As a Vendor using the Storzu Platform, you are solely responsible for:","termsS3Items":["All content, images, descriptions, and information published on your vendor website","The accuracy of product or service listings, pricing, and availability","Compliance with all applicable local, state, national, and international laws and regulations","Obtaining all necessary licenses, permits, and registrations for your business operations","Handling customer inquiries, complaints, returns, and refunds","Tax collection, reporting, and remittance as required by law","Ensuring your business practices comply with consumer protection laws","Data protection and privacy obligations concerning your customers\' personal data"],"termsS4Title":"4. Platform as Technology Provider","termsS4Intro":"Storzu provides website creation technology, hosting infrastructure, and related tools only. We are not a party to any transaction between Vendors and their customers. We do not:","termsS4Items":["Control, endorse, or guarantee the quality of any Vendor\'s products or services","Process payments on behalf of Vendors (Vendors integrate their own payment gateways)","Verify the accuracy of Vendor content or business claims","Assume any responsibility for Vendor-customer disputes","Act as an employer, agent, or partner of any Vendor"],"termsS5Title":"5. Prohibited Content & Activities","termsS5Intro":"Vendors must not use the Platform to:","termsS5Items":["Publish illegal, harmful, threatening, abusive, defamatory, or obscene content","Sell counterfeit, stolen, or illegally obtained goods","Infringe on intellectual property rights of others","Distribute malware or engage in phishing activities","Engage in fraud, deceptive practices, or misrepresentation","Violate any applicable laws or regulations"],"termsS5Enforcement":"We reserve the right to suspend or terminate Vendor accounts that violate these prohibitions without prior notice.","termsS6Title":"6. Indemnification","termsS6":"You agree to indemnify, defend, and hold harmless Storzu, its officers, directors, employees, and agents from and against any and all claims, damages, losses, liabilities, costs, and expenses (including reasonable attorneys\' fees) arising from or related to your use of the Platform, your Vendor website content, your products or services, your violation of these Terms, any dispute between you and your customers, or your violation of any third-party rights.","termsS7Title":"7. Limitation of Liability","termsS7P1":"TO THE MAXIMUM EXTENT PERMITTED BY LAW, TYCHHO SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES, OR ANY LOSS OF PROFITS OR REVENUES, WHETHER INCURRED DIRECTLY OR INDIRECTLY, ARISING FROM YOUR USE OF THE PLATFORM.","termsS7P2":"Storzu\'s total liability for any claim arising from or relating to these Terms shall not exceed the amounts paid by you to Storzu during the twelve (12) months preceding the claim.","termsS8Title":"8. Intellectual Property","termsS8":"Vendors retain ownership of their content. By using the Platform, Vendors grant Storzu a limited, non-exclusive license to host, display, and distribute their content solely for the purpose of providing the Platform services. Storzu retains all rights to the Platform technology, templates, and branding.","termsS9Title":"9. Termination","termsS9":"Either party may terminate the agreement at any time. Storzu may suspend or terminate your account immediately if you violate these Terms. Upon termination, your vendor website will be taken offline. You are responsible for exporting your data before termination.","termsS10Title":"10. Dispute Resolution","termsS10":"Any disputes arising from these Terms shall be resolved through good-faith negotiation. If unresolved, disputes shall be submitted to binding arbitration in accordance with applicable arbitration rules. These Terms shall be governed by the laws of India.","termsS11Title":"11. Contact","termsS11":"For questions about these Terms, contact us at:","aupS1Title":"1. Purpose","aupS1":"This Acceptable Use Policy (\\"AUP\\") outlines the rules and guidelines for using the Storzu platform. All Vendors must comply with this policy. Violation of this AUP may result in immediate suspension or termination of your account and vendor website.","aupS2Title":"2. Prohibited Content","aupS2Intro":"You must not publish, host, or distribute content that:","aupS2Items":["Is illegal or promotes illegal activities","Infringes on intellectual property, trademark, or copyright rights","Contains hate speech, harassment, or discrimination","Is sexually explicit, pornographic, or exploitative","Promotes violence, terrorism, or self-harm","Contains personal information of others without consent","Is fraudulent, misleading, or deceptive","Contains malware, viruses, or malicious code","Violates export control or sanctions laws"],"aupS3Title":"3. Prohibited Activities","aupS3Intro":"You must not use the Platform to:","aupS3Items":["Send spam, unsolicited messages, or engage in phishing","Attempt to gain unauthorized access to our systems or other users\' accounts","Disrupt or interfere with the Platform\'s infrastructure or other users\' websites","Sell counterfeit, stolen, or illegally obtained goods or services","Engage in pyramid schemes, multi-level marketing scams, or Ponzi schemes","Scrape, crawl, or harvest data from other vendor websites without permission","Circumvent any security measures or access controls","Use the Platform for cryptocurrency mining or resource-intensive automated tasks"],"aupS4Title":"4. Prohibited Products & Services","aupS4Intro":"The following categories of products and services are prohibited on the Platform:","aupS4Items":["Illegal drugs or controlled substances","Weapons, firearms, or explosives","Counterfeit or pirated goods","Gambling services (unless properly licensed)","Adult content or services","Products that violate applicable trade regulations"],"aupS5Title":"5. Enforcement","aupS5Intro":"Storzu reserves the right to investigate and take action against any violations of this AUP, including but not limited to:","aupS5Items":["Issuing warnings to the Vendor","Temporarily suspending the vendor website","Permanently terminating the Vendor account","Removing offending content without prior notice","Reporting illegal activities to law enforcement","Pursuing legal remedies"],"aupS6Title":"6. Reporting Violations","aupS6P1":"If you become aware of any content or activity that violates this AUP, please report it to us immediately at:","aupS6P2":"Please include the vendor website URL, a description of the violation, and any supporting evidence. We will review all reports and take appropriate action.","aupS7Title":"7. Changes to This Policy","aupS7":"We may update this AUP from time to time. Vendors will be notified of material changes. Continued use of the Platform after changes constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.","dmcaS1Title":"1. Overview","dmcaS1":"Storzu respects the intellectual property rights of others and expects our Vendors to do the same. As a technology platform provider, Storzu hosts websites created by independent Vendors. We respond to notices of alleged copyright infringement in accordance with applicable laws, including the Digital Millennium Copyright Act (DMCA) and the Indian Information Technology Act, 2000.","dmcaS2Title":"2. Filing a Copyright Complaint","dmcaS2Intro":"If you believe that content hosted on a Storzu vendor website infringes your copyright, please submit a notice containing the following information:","dmcaS2Items":["Your name, address, telephone number, and email address","A description of the copyrighted work you claim has been infringed","The URL(s) of the infringing content on the vendor website","A statement that you have a good-faith belief that the disputed use is not authorized by the copyright owner, its agent, or the law","A statement, made under penalty of perjury, that the information in your notice is accurate and that you are the copyright owner or authorized to act on behalf of the owner","Your physical or electronic signature"],"dmcaS3Title":"3. Designated Agent","dmcaS3":"Send copyright notices to our designated agent:","dmcaS3Agent":"Storzu Copyright Agent","dmcaS4Title":"4. How We Handle Notices","dmcaS4Intro":"Upon receiving a valid copyright notice, Storzu will:","dmcaS4Items":["Acknowledge receipt of the notice","Review the complaint for completeness and validity","Remove or disable access to the allegedly infringing content","Notify the Vendor whose content was removed","Provide the Vendor an opportunity to submit a counter-notification"],"dmcaS5Title":"5. Counter-Notification","dmcaS5Intro":"If you are a Vendor and believe your content was removed in error, you may submit a counter-notification containing:","dmcaS5Items":["Your name, address, and telephone number","Identification of the content that was removed and its location before removal","A statement under penalty of perjury that you have a good-faith belief the content was removed by mistake or misidentification","A statement that you consent to the jurisdiction of the appropriate courts","Your physical or electronic signature"],"dmcaS5Outro":"Upon receiving a valid counter-notification, we will forward it to the original complainant and restore the content within 10-14 business days unless the complainant files a court action.","dmcaS6Title":"6. Repeat Infringer Policy","dmcaS6":"Storzu maintains a policy of terminating the accounts of Vendors who are repeat infringers. A Vendor who receives three or more valid copyright complaints may have their account permanently terminated without prior notice.","dmcaS7Title":"7. Good Faith","dmcaS7":"Filing a false copyright notice may result in legal liability. Before filing, please consider whether the use may be permitted under fair use or other legal doctrines. Storzu reserves the right to disregard notices that appear to be fraudulent or filed in bad faith."},"categoryView":{"searchPlaceholder":"Search in this category...","filterColor":"Color","filterMaterial":"Material","filterPattern":"Pattern","filterSize":"Size