{count}})","creating":"Creating products... {{done}} of {{total}}","doneTitle":"Products Created Successfully!","doneBody":"Your catalog has been updated with the new products.","maxBatchAlert":"Maximum {{max}} images per batch","skippedAlert":"Only {{remaining}} more images can be added. {{skipped}} images were skipped.","noReadyAlert":"No products ready to create. Ensure all products have a name and price.","doneAlert":"{{created}} products created/updated successfully. {{failed}} failed.","examples":{"mobiles":{"intro":"Example: 30 iPhone 15 Pro at ₹1,29,000 each, 256GB — each in a different colour (Natural Titanium, Blue Titanium, White, Black)","materialLabel":"Build / Storage","materialHelper":"Used by AI to write the product description (build material, storage, etc.)."},"jewellery":{"intro":"Example: 20 Temple necklaces at ₹45,000 each, 22kt gold — each with different stone work","materialLabel":"Material / Purity","materialHelper":"AI uses this to write accurate product descriptions"},"fashion":{"intro":"Example: 50 Kanchivaram Silk sarees at ₹8,500 each, 6.3m — each with different colors & designs","materialLabel":"Material / Fabric","materialHelper":"AI uses this to write accurate product descriptions"},"pooja":{"intro":"Example: 25 Brass Lakshmi idols at ₹1,200 each, 4-inch — each photo a different finish (antique, polished, gold-plated)","materialLabel":"Material","materialHelper":"AI uses this to write accurate product descriptions (material, deity, size)"},"nursery":{"intro":"Example: 40 Money Plants at ₹249 each, medium size — each photo a different pot (terracotta, ceramic, hanging)","materialLabel":"Pot / Container","materialHelper":"AI uses this in the description (pot type, size, finish)"},"generic":{"intro":"Example: 20 of the same product at the same price — each photo a different colour or pattern","materialLabel":"Material","materialHelper":"AI uses this to write accurate product descriptions"}}},"upi":{"paymentCompleted":"Payment completed",